{"title":"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 20","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> be a real number selected uniformly at random between 100 and 200. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/b/a3be0e595db14d52d860e5c3efad6705c02667c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor {\\sqrt{x}} \\rfloor = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"86\" height=\"22\" />, find the probability that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/e/3de65f71ed85080a3fd8aa2e1ba3a315d26f7586.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor {\\sqrt{100x}} \\rfloor = 120$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"119\" height=\"22\" />. (<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/3/a534b4ab41f83393b838dccc72752697db4fe589.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor {v} \\rfloor$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" /> means the greatest integer less than or equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/f/a9f23bf124b6b2b2a993eb313c72e678664ac74a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$v$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />.)\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/a/5dad7f5e3fee155aa0c04ab2bbafceb2100a9361.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)} \\ \\frac{2}{25} \\qquad \\text{(B)} \\ \\frac{241}{2500} \\qquad \\text{(C)} \\ \\frac{1}{10} \\qquad \\text{(D)} \\ \\frac{96}{625} \\qquad \\text{(E)} \\ 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"409\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/5/dd5c6725f4dd9957020d2b4423405cd2d0dafd89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor\\sqrt{x}\\rfloor=12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"83\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/a/f6a7c360d75c7b46f4e8a7f85274d4c1d51dd098.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12\\leq\\sqrt{x}&lt;13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"109\" height=\"18\" /> and thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/1/391cb1706293b7b4f98f598cabf9e73db6b3c5c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$144\\leq x&lt;169$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"112\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>The successful region is when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/9/009311bf7992f51f892891e61e2a342a456477c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$120\\leq10\\sqrt{x}&lt;121$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"145\" height=\"18\" /> in which case <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/d/35d67154f92fd617b0190ee7deed8d48e5fb6005.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12\\leq\\sqrt{x}&lt;12.1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"123\" height=\"18\" />  Thus, the successful region is when\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/f/b2fa28342b49d4a51faf759f9997e7696b3c9554.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[144\\leq x&lt;146.41\\]\" width=\"134\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>The successful region consists of a 2.41 long segment, while the total possibilities region is 25 wide.  Thus, the probability is\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/8/808f0ba392b5ef18f5bceff36869961a5cb66d84.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{2.41}{25}=\\boxed{\\frac{241}{2500}};\\;\\boxed{B}.\\]\" width=\"152\" height=\"48\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME\" title=\"1989 AHSME\">1989 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1989 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1989\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">Problem 19</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">Problem 21</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\